'bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0067.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0025.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adelaidepan2012@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"45.34.81.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441589326,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Amandajone","Id":284703,"Name":"Amandajone","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 13 September 2015 - 06:01 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1442196107,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9900197f45da3c3d821ea746d7554f97","RawContent":"I was going to say # 1 but I changed my mind .... #2 is my fave. Love them both but on #1 it almost looks like the underlay to the lace up top is a bit scant and could show too much skin. If you get my point.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904631,"PostDate":1442195968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was going to say # 1 but I changed my mind .... #2 is my fave. Love them both but on #1 it almost looks like the underlay to the lace up top is a bit scant and could show too much skin. If you get my point. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f18ea083a3e9fad126a345581ded7978","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Both are very pretty. I think I like #1 a little bit better only because I don&#039;t like the \"one strap\" look of #2&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904642,"PostDate":1442206224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Both are very pretty. I think I like #1 a little bit better only because I don't like the \"one strap\" look of #2<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69d5014b884a7d2e3ed70a9118382582","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Amandajone\" post=\"1904630\" timestamp=\"1442195602\"]\n[size=3]I am looking for flower girl dresses for my wedding. I have searched for a long time.finally I find two very [url=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/\"]beautiful flower girl dress[\/url] ,but I can&#039;t decide which one I should buy ? I hope there are someone can give me some suggestions,thanks.[\/size]\n[size=3]this is the pictures of flower girl dress:[\/size]\n[size=3][img]http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg[\/img][\/size]\n[img]http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg[\/img][\/quote]@[member=\"Amandajone\"] i love #1 super cute !\n\nHappy Planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1904686,"PostDate":1442258206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Amandajone, on 13 September 2015 - 05:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">I am looking for flower girl dresses for my wedding. I have searched for a long time.finally I find two very <a href='http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>beautiful flower girl dress<\/a> ,but I can't decide which one I\u00a0should buy\u00a0? I hope there are someone can give me some suggestions,thanks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\">this is the pictures of flower girl dress:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:13px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0067.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0067.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.jvsdress.com\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/thumbnail\/600x900\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/j\/v\/jvsdg0025.jpg\" alt=\"jvsdg0025.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284703\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284703-amandajone\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Amandajone<\/span><\/a> i love #1 super cute !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"139.194.101.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c164ae604f346f74457201619899f88c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;wow cool....&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i love the second one..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904765,"PostDate":1442330374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wow cool....\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i love the second one..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430664822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79587,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87203bac5b82ead19d9769d4fb5cf52b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Both are super cute! But as a wedding &amp;nbsp;photographer, it&#039;s always kinda cool when the bride&#039;s dress and bridesmaid\/flower girl dresses all kind of mesh together and compliment one another. Can you post a photo of your dress?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904805,"PostDate":1442343338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n        