&lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Century Gothic\"&gt;All these gorgeous rings - agh...&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\"&gt;&lt;font face=\"Century Gothic\"&gt;My ring is a cushion cut in a platinum diamond wire setting. The ring&#039;s shank is single not double wire with a Single Row of Pave Diamonds unlike in the attached picture. When i saw it, I knew I had to have it :)\n \n &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/loretuke2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;3800&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;my ring.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:75.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11223,"PostDate":1165886216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font face=\"Century Gothic\">All these gorgeous rings - agh...<\/font><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font 