We have picked the beach for our ceremony and poolside for dinner. I&#039;m hoping that some brides may have some recommendations. \n\n\nCan you extend your private event poolside?\n\n\nHow much is the bridal suite to rent?\n\n\nThanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1908101,"PostDate":1449200006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey I recently booked my wedding at the Now Larimar for October 2016! We have picked the beach for our ceremony and poolside for dinner. I'm hoping that some brides may have some recommendations. <br><br>\nCan you extend your private event poolside?<br><br>\nHow much is the bridal suite to rent?<br><br>\nThanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ssheridan03@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.242.233.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449196795,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sheridan2016","Id":285512,"Name":"Sheridan2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.73.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79780,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 04 December 2015 - 07:56 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1449244617,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e13ff87acef8dc5b65ae39e2d98409e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Sheridan2016, and CONGRATS on your Oct 2016 destination wedding at the NOW Larimar!!! You&#039;ve come to a great place for lots of excellent resources to help with your planning decisions, so well done on getting a wonderful start already!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera to inspire you further.....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.jpg\" alt=\"10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jpg\" alt=\"1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1978561_10152285892294487_762981068_o.jpg\" alt=\"1978561_10152285892294487_762981068_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and these from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153455288424487.1073741940.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Jade Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfl1\/t31.0-8\/11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814103284_o.jpg\" alt=\"11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11741041_10153455298164487_3580730342103220273_o.jpg\" alt=\"11741041_10153455298164487_3580730342103\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163978241_o.jpg\" alt=\"11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfl1\/t31.0-8\/11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452497034_o.jpg\" alt=\"11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908112,"PostDate":1449244515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Sheridan2016, and CONGRATS on your Oct 2016 destination wedding at the NOW Larimar!!! You've come to a great place for lots of excellent resources to help with your planning decisions, so well done on getting a wonderful start already!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera to inspire you further.....taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.jpg\" alt=\"10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jpg\" alt=\"1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1978561_10152285892294487_762981068_o.jpg\" alt=\"1978561_10152285892294487_762981068_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and these from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153455288424487.1073741940.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Jade Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfl1\/t31.0-8\/11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814103284_o.jpg\" alt=\"11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11741041_10153455298164487_3580730342103220273_o.jpg\" alt=\"11741041_10153455298164487_3580730342103\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163978241_o.jpg\" alt=\"11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfl1\/t31.0-8\/11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452497034_o.jpg\" alt=\"11732001_10153455298619487_3278415132452\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79780,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39e1ebc3582f3ffcbf27645ec420a540","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Sheridan2016&amp;nbsp; Congrats and welcome! You&#039;ll find this site is full of information that will help you through your planning journey.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would recommend doing a search up top for your resort and read the forums that come up. There are several and odds are, any questions you have will likely be answered somewhere in one of the forums. As well, you can take a look through the Resort Reviews section and see what past brides have said about your resort. We&#039;ve had several DR brides over the last year.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908182,"PostDate":1449518752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Sheridan2016\u00a0 Congrats and welcome! You'll find this site is full of information that will help you through your planning journey.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would recommend doing a search up top for your resort and read the forums that come up. There are several and odds are, any questions you have will likely be answered somewhere in one of the forums. As well, you can take a look through the Resort Reviews section and see what past brides have said about your resort. We've had several DR brides over the last year.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79780","Title":"Now Larimar","LastPostDate":1449518752},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
